Luma Profiles is source-available, not open source. You may use it for free (also at work), read and modify
the code, and share free copies with this notice and a link to the original project. You may NOT sell it,
charge for it, publish it in an app store under another publisher, bundle it in a paid product or monetize it
in any way without a written commercial license from Código Limpio, with a royalty of 15% of the gross revenue
(paid quarterly with a revenue report) unless that agreement says otherwise. The names and logos are not licensed. Contributions may be
relicensed by Código Limpio. No warranty. Versions 0.10.0 and earlier, as already received, remain under MIT.
